a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-900\">Age-Aware Browsing</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium leading-relaxed\">Structured content buckets tailored for toddlers (2–4), early learners (5–7), and big kids (8–12).</p></div><div class=\"bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-sm p-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs space-y-2\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-purple-100 text-purple-900 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-eye w-4 h-4 text-purple-700\"><path d=\"M2.062 12.348a1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 19.876 0 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1-19.876 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-900\">Parent-Friendly Experience</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium leading-relaxed\">No forced registrations, zero invasive tracking, and kid-appropriate content controls.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-sm p-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs space-y-2\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-purple-100 text-purple-900 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check w-4 h-4 text-purple-700\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-900\">Privacy &amp; Safety Embedded</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium leading-relaxed\">Official YouTube privacy-enhanced no-cookie player embeds keep playback safe.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-4 flex items-center justify-center relative\"><div class=\"relative w-full max-w-[260px] sm:max-w-[300px] aspect-square flex items-center justify-center\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-purple-200/40 rounded-full blur-2xl\"></div><img alt=\"KiddoTube Mascot Buddy\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"w-full h-full object-contain drop-shadow-xl relative z-10 transition-transform duration-300 hover:scale-105\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/mascot-2.png\"/></div></div></div></section></div></main><footer class=\"mt-auto bg-white border-t border-slate-200/80 py-12\"><div class=\"max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-10\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8\"><div class=\"md:col-span-1 space-y-3\"><a class=\"inline-block focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-600 rounded-lg\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"KiddoTube Logo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"38\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-9 w-auto object-contain\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/Logo.png\"/></a><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 leading-relaxed\">KiddoTube Media Inc. — Safe, curated video discovery platform for kids. COPPA &amp; GDPR-K compliant.</p><p class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-400\">Support: support@kiddotubes.com</p></div><div class=\"space-y-3\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-900\">Explore</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600\"><li><a class=\"hover:text-purple-700 transition-colors focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-600 rounded-sm\" href=\"/\">Home</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-purple-700 transition-colors focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-600 rounded-sm\" href=\"/category/2-4\">Browse by Age</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-purple-700 transition-colors focus:ring-2 focus: