ngs\\n\\nJoin BluLoo on a delightful pond adventure with the \\\"Five Little Ducks\\\" song! 🦆🌈 Sing along and enjoy the fun-filled journey of our five little ducks as they swim and play. This classic nursery rhyme is perfect for kids to learn counting and enjoy a lively, musical experience.\\n\\nSing along to the popular kids song \\\"Five Little Ducks\\\" with BluLoo! Join the colorful ducks on an adventure in this fun nursery rhyme video.\\n\\nLyrics:\\n\\nVerse 1:\\nFive little ducks swimming in the pond,\\nRed, blue, green, and yellow, and one that’s blonde.\\nQuack, quack, quack, they’re having so much fun,\\nSplashing in the water, underneath the sun.\\n\\nChorus:\\nColorful ducks, swimming all around,\\nIn a line, they follow, never making a sound.\\nWaddle, waddle, waddle, to the grassy shore,\\nFive little ducks, let's count them once more.\\n\\nVerse 2:\\nRed duck leads, with a quack and a smile,\\nBlue duck follows, in a very cool style.\\nGreen duck wiggles, with feathers so bright,\\nYellow duck dances, oh what a sight!\\n\\nChorus:\\nColorful ducks, swimming all around,\\nIn a line, they follow, never making a sound.\\nWaddle, waddle, waddle, to the grassy shore,\\nFive little ducks, let's count them once more.\\n\\nOur kids songs and nursery rhymes, like the \\\"Five Little Ducks\\\" song, are designed to be both educational and entertaining. Children will love the colorful animation and catchy tune as they learn counting with our adorable ducks.\\n\\nDon't forget to like, comment, and subscribe to BluLoo for more fun and educational nursery rhymes and kids songs! Hit the bell icon to stay updated with our latest videos.\\n\\nContact us: contact@bluloo.org\\n\\nFollow BluLoo:\\nSubscribe to our YouTube Channel: \\nhttps://www.youtube.com/channel/UCpxf2P7fztkrT7NTtQRBG6A\\n\\nListen on Spotify: \\nhttps://open.spotify.com/artist/2hBqftNswdrqlEHYj2zuCY?si=gGh_nNYTQA6w9-tkVwf26w\\u0026nd=1\\u0026dlsi=72d94e000c3d48c1\\n\\nWatch all our playlists:\\nhttps://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLFOJyZSvt9wGmMSppVlOeEj5ACh2-6llI\\nhttps://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLFOJyZSvt9wEY43WvWfXJwQWwKSd0ug-i\\nhttps://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLFOJyZSvt9wFxF_1pdilSTuaE09Tl6RC2\\nhttps://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLFOJyZSvt9wHF5oRiHnbkfS7GSTx32bZf\\n\\n#FiveLittleDucks #KidsSongs #NurseryRhymes #BluLoo #EducationalSongs #ChildrensMusic #FunLearning #SingAlong #KidsEducation\\n\\nJoin BluLoo at the pond and discover the fun of counting with colorful ducks! 🌟🎶\\n\\nCopyright © BluLoo. All rights reserved.\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"40:T7d7,🎨 Help your baby, toddler, preschooler or kindergartener learn all the colors of the rainbow with this adorable learning video for kids! 🖌️ Learn all the names of colors in a family friendly flash card environment designed just for kids. It's like going to school, but way more fun! 🤩 \\n\\n✏️ Learn colors through exciting and interactive flashcards, all in a delightful learning environment! 🍭 Great for kids of all ages, and the perfect way to teach all of the colors of the rainbow to preschoolers and kindergarteners. Let this family-friendly video give your child a head start on their education! ✔️ Color song is an ideal baby video for preschool learning. ✨  \\n\\n✍️ Learn Colors With Lucas and Ruby:\\n🟢 Green \\n🟣 Purple\\n🔴 Red\\n⚫ Black\\n🌸 Pink\\n⚪ White\\n🟡 Yellow\\n🟠 Orange\\n🟤 Brown\\n🔵 Blue\\n🔘 Grey\\n\\n⭐ RV AppStudios is thrilled to add our newest song for kids to our collection, and one we're sure your kids will love singing along-to! 👍 As always, be sure to LIKE and SHARE this kids song to show more families that it can be easy and fun to learn 🔔 And don't forget to SUBSCRIBE for more free animated sing-along songs and nursery rhymes for kids by RV Kids! 🔥\\n\\n📢 Coloring pages for kids and much more - https://www.rvappstudios.com\\n\\n🎯 Try our FREE Educational Apps for Babies \\u0026 Toddlers:\\n         🟡 Google Play: https://play.google.com/store/apps/dev?id=7430005971129979939\\n         🟣 iOS: https://apps.apple.com/developer/rv-appstudios-llc/id340181308\\n         🟢 RV AppStudios: https://www.rvappstudios.com/kidsapp.html\\n\\n🌟 Fun educational videos for toddlers by RV AppStudios:\\n🎨 Sing \\u0026 Learn Colors for Children - https://youtu.be/PoMPLwKgeKw\\n🐊 Learn Alphabet for Kids with Animals - https://youtu.be/MZI1izUMLu4\\n📖 Counting Numbers 1 to 20 for Kids - https://youtu.be/2KwCtfvvMsY\\n🖍️ Colors For Kids Song - https://youtu.be/Mc5S5P_yQ0A\\n         \\nCopyright © RV AppStudios\\n\\n#LearnColors #EducationalVideos #Color\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"4:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"space-y-12\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L12\\\",null,{}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L13\\\",null,{\\\"title\\\":\\\"🔥 Trending for Kids\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Popular discoveries for young explorers\\\",\\\"seeAllHref\\\":\\\"/category/2-4\\\",\\\"videos\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"_slpLnBoHek\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Meow Meow Billi Karti | Hindi Rhyme For Kids | Balgeet In Hindi\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Fun educational nursery rhymes for toddlers and kids with cute animated characters.\\\",\\\"channelTitle\\\":\\\"Zolotune Toons\\\",\\\"publishedAt\\\":\\\"2024-01-15T00:00:00Z\\\",\\\"duration\\\":\\\"6:16\\\",\\\"ageGroup\\\":\\\"2–4\\\",\\\"categorySlug\\\":\\\"songs\\\",\\\"thumbnails\\\":{\\\"high\\\":{\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/_slpLnBoHek/hqdefault.jpg\\\"},\\\"medium\\\":{\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/_slpLnBoHek/mqdefault.jpg\\\"}}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"fC7oUOUEEi4\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Wheels on the Bus Go Round and Round | CoComelon Nursery Rhymes\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Sing along with JJ and family to the classic nursery rhyme Wheels on the Bus!\\\",\\\"channelTitle\\\":\\\"CoComelon - Nursery Rhymes\\\",\\\"publishedAt\\\":\\\"2024-02-10T00:00:00Z\\\",\\\"duration\\\":\\\"3:32\\\",\\\"ageGroup\\\":\\\"0–2\\\",\\\"categorySlug\\\":\\\"songs\\\",\\\"thumbna